        "id": "intro",
        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Platformer Playground Starter Pack\n\nLow-poly playground models for platform games: floating islands, platforms, spring pads, checkpoints, switches, hazards and collectibles. Includes nine animation clips. Run to expose each GLB as a named output. No provider or API key required.\n\nModels use meters, Y up, forward -Z and bottom-level origins. Deck tiles use a 2 m grid. Nine models include visual clips for spinning, bouncing, pressing, raising, opening, travel or breaking. Animate physics roots separately for moving platforms and hazards. Download a model output and upload it to your project before importing it into a 3D game."
        },
